<title>INDIA: Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - April 4.</title>
<headline>Stocks which moved India's BSE Index - April 4.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement at the close of trade on Friday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day and their percentage contribution to the net change.</p>
<p>The index at the close was 3550.37, 9.28 points or 0.26 percent lower than Thursday's close.</p>
<p>.</p>
